vgx draw caches (Galaxy back end, GXV_VGL_FRAGMEMO / GXV_VGL_UNIREUSE): a per-program memo of patched fragment programs by
(blend info, output format, multisample mode), and the re-use of a program's last uniform-ring copy while its uniform values and
the uniform pool generation are unchanged. Both off until vglSetDrawCaches turns them on; vglGetDrawCacheStats gives counters.
Applies after 0013; tools/vitagl/fbo_msaa.py, gpu_timers.py and build-vitagl.sh's source patches apply unchanged after it.

